      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic pain of the knee in children and adolescents may result from multiple etiologies, mainly related to the pathology of the extensor apparatus. The diagnosis is mostly based on a good interrogatory, a careful and systematic physical examination and standard X-rays. Complementary investigations such as arthrography, arthroscopy and CT scan are only needed in a limited number of cases. The pathology of the hip is part of the differential diagnosis."},
